<view class="page"
  ><view class="title">我的账号。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card"
    ><view class="subtitle">微信已连接</view><view class="muted">{{user.email || '尚未绑定邮箱'}}</view></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{user && !user.email}}" class="card"
    ><view class="subtitle">绑定邮箱</view
    ><view class="muted"
      >绑定后可以在网页使用邮箱登录同一账号。已有独立账号暂不能合并；已有邮箱账号请退出后，从登录页选择“我已有邮箱账号”。</view
    >
    <label class="field"
      ><text class="label">邮箱</text
      ><input class="input" value="{{email}}" data-field="email" bindinput="input" /></label
    ><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy || countdown > 0 || !email}}" bindtap="sendCode">
      {{countdown > 0 ? countdown + ' 秒后重发' : '发送验证码'}}</button
    ><label class="field"
      ><text class="label">验证码</text
      ><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="6" value="{{code}}" data-field="code" bindinput="input" /></label
    ><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !email || !code}}" bindtap="bind">
      绑定邮箱
    </button></view
  >
  <button class="danger" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button>
</view>
